// The App Shortcuts phrases Siri matches, English.
//
// The App Intents compiler requires this exact format: the KEY repeats a phrase declared in Swift
// with ${applicationName}/${section}/${query} placeholders, and EVERY key must contain
// ${applicationName} — an utterance without it fails the build with "Invalid Utterance". The value
// is what Siri listens for in an English (US) locale.
"Open ${applicationName}" = "Open ${applicationName}";
"Открыть ${applicationName}" = "Открыть ${applicationName}";

"Open ${applicationName} ${section}" = "Open ${applicationName} ${section}";

"Search ${applicationName} for ${query}" = "Search ${applicationName} for ${query}";
